+// Thoron M-Notifier in the toolbar (P5.75, P5.76): an envelope with the count
+// of new mail (or of all unread mail, as the person chose) of every watched
+// Google account the profile is signed in to. Pressed, it opens the
+// M-Notifier's menu (thoron_mail_ui.h). Where it is and where in the toolbar
+// are the person's choice, as for Thoron adblock's shield. Not in an
